sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports prepaid cards
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: Prepaid card with positive amount is available
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State(s): N/a

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <prepaid card id>, idToken.type = <prepaid card id type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status Accepted<br>idTokenInfo.cacheExpiryDateTime <current date/time>

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Started, idToken.idToken = <prepaid card id>, idToken.type = <prepaid card id type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status Accepted<br>idTokenInfo.cacheExpiryDateTime <cacheExpiryDateTime from step 2><br>transactionLimit.maxCost = <not omitted>
